            "heading_size": 16,
            "content": "<p><strong>Organized Storage</strong><br/>A divided main compartment and multiple pockets keep wipes, diapers, snacks, your phone, keys, and wallet within easy reach.</p><p><strong>Two Insulated Cup Holders</strong><br/>Separate insulated holders accommodate baby bottles or drinks, keeping them upright while helping slow temperature changes.</p><p><strong>Detachable Wristlet Pouch</strong><br/>Remove the zippered front pouch to take small valuables with you without carrying the entire organizer.</p><p><strong>Adjustable Stroller Attachment</strong><br/>Hook-and-loop straps adjust around different stroller handles. Compatibility depends on handle shape and spacing.</p><p><strong>Shoulder Bag Option</strong><br/>The included shoulder strap lets you carry the organizer away from the stroller.</p><p><strong>Package Contents</strong><br/>Includes one stroller organizer with a detachable pouch and one shoulder strap. Bottles and other display accessories are not included.</p>",
