          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "1. Will this organizer fit my stroller?",
            "content": "<p>The adjustable attachment straps accommodate many stroller handle styles. Fit depends on your stroller’s handle shape and spacing, so check the attachment area before purchasing.</p>",
