            "content": "<p>The main compartment and smaller pockets provide space for wipes, diapers, snacks, your phone, keys, and wallet. The detachable front pouch lets you take small valuables with you without removing the entire organizer.</p>",
            "default_open": false,
            "icon_code": "",
            "icon_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "question_KtVzDN": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "&nbsp;4. Can I carry it without a stroller?&nbsp;",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Remove the organizer and use the included shoulder strap to carry it as a bag, or detach the wristlet pouch for quick errands. When using it on a stroller, distribute items evenly and follow your stroller manufacturer’s accessory weight limits.</p>",
            "default_open": false,
            "icon_code": "",
            "icon_color": "#000000"
          }
